<h3>About General Physics 1 - Tablani</h3>

<p>This project will supplement other OER material to create a fully open General Physics I course. The collection includes lecture slides (and activity video as available)</p>

<div>This material was funded by the Fund for the Improvement of Postsecondary Education (FIPSE) of the U.S. Department of Education for the Open Textbooks Pilot grant awarded to Middlesex College for the Open Textbook Collaborative.</div>

